@startuml
title TelcoGuard — System Architecture

package "Frontend" {
  [Streamlit UI] as UI
}

package "API & Services" {
  [FastAPI Model API] as API
  [GenAI Service] as GenAI
}

package "Data & Storage" {
  database "OLTP DB (Postgres)" as DB
  database "Analytics Warehouse" as Warehouse
  folder "Blob Storage" as Blob
}

package "MLOps" {
  [Azure ML Workspace] as AML
  [Model Registry] as Registry
  [CI/CD (GitHub Actions)] as CICD
}

UI --> API : user requests
API --> Registry : fetch model
API --> GenAI : call for insights
GenAI --> Blob : read knowledge base
API --> Warehouse : analytics queries
CICD --> AML : deploy models
AML --> Registry : register model

@enduml